@startuml playback-interpreter
' SPEC: _spec/apps/starchess/core/turn/playback-interpreter.puml
' purpose: Sole interpreter — EndScTurnResult → cues; never re-resolves.
!include ../../../../themes/proveo.puml

skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultTextAlignment left

title StarChess · Playback interpreter (sole path)

database "EndScTurnResult" as RES <<db>>
component "bindTimeline(dispatch)" as BIND <<async>>
component "TimelineCommitGate\nbinder coalesce only" as GATE <<async>>
component "timelinePlayer.ts\nproject + playTimeline" as TL <<async>>
component "playResolveWave.ts\nwave subset (tutorial)" as WAVE <<async>>
component "matchReducer TIMELINE_*" as RED <<async>>
component "AnimationStage" as STAGE <<app>>
component "placementToMap (public)" as HELP <<db>>

RES ARROW_QUEUE TL
RES ARROW_OPTIONAL WAVE : tutorial steppers
WAVE ARROW_MAIN TL : cues subset
BIND ARROW_MAIN TL : onStart/Commit/Done
TL ARROW_QUEUE GATE : callbacks
GATE ARROW_MAIN RED : TIMELINE_*
TL ARROW_OPTIONAL HELP
RED ARROW_MAIN RES : TIMELINE_DONE → next snap
STAGE ARROW_OPTIONAL RED

note bottom
  **Pattern:** Interpreter. One binder, one player.
  playResolveWave is a **cue filter**, not a second engine.
  **TimelineCommitGate** is binder coalesce — not a second interpreter.
  Perf path: ""architecture/timeline-perf.puml"" · compositor relief (shipped):
  ""architecture/timeline-vfx-density.puml"".
  DualNav intent ghosts: ""EndScTurnResult.queue"" (stamped SCFEN Q:) —
  never reconstruct classical from resolved moves.
  **Deleted:** playResolve.ts; classicalActionsFromResolve.ts.
end note
@enduml
